text.en:
The following sitios in the Municipality of Santa Fe, Province of Leyte, are constituted as barrios of said municipality, to wit:
Sitio Hinapolon of barrio San Juan to Barrio Hinapolon;
Sitio Badiangay of barrio San Miguel to Barrio Badiangay;
Sitio Pinangotoran of barrio San Juan to barrio Katipunan;
Sitio Curba to Barrio Curba; and
Sitio Km. 16 to Barrio Milagrosa.

